### D-015 — EMIS Web / EMIS-X Terminology Boundary
**Phase:** All phases (retrospective and going forward)
**Date:** 2026-05-29

**Ruling (CSO Dan Watts):**

> "Going forward the EMIS Web reference should only relate to the backend storage and ingestion. The actual presentation of the documents is all in EMIS-X. When EMIS Web is referenced it is causing confusion."

**Binding rule for all hazard cards:**

| Layer | System reference |
